# Cloudflare Pages `_headers` — long-cache immutable assets.
#
# Astro emits content-hashed filenames for `_astro/*` and we ship the
# self-hosted font files with no content-hash but a stable filename per
# asset (Source Serif 4 Roman/Italic, Inter, Noto Serif Devanagari, etc).
# Both are safe to mark immutable: changing a font swaps the asset path
# at build time, and `_astro/*` bundles have unique hashes per build.
#
# This file ships unchanged on every deploy. Edit when adding new asset
# directories under /public.
#
# Goal: shed the re-validate roundtrip on repeat-view (CrUX field p75)
# rather than the cold-load Lighthouse number.

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# OG verse text precache (built by `scripts/seo-build-og-cache.ts`). One
# JSON per verse, ~1-3KB each, ~334 files total. The OG handler in
# `functions/og/_shared.ts` reads these via ASSETS.fetch on the hot path
# instead of running a libsql HTTP query against Turso — eliminating the
# tail-latency DB-timeout failure mode Phase 8 T+24h flagged.
# Files are rebuilt on every deploy from `db/sohamhamso.db`; content-
# stable per build so immutable + 1y max-age is safe.
/og-cache/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
